  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the Toxic Mayhem factory, Fang grew up scavenging scrap and dodging the Drone Ducks that patrol the streets. The scars on his beak are a testament to his early forays into 'acquire-a-DRIP-at-all-costs' territory disputes, and the Shadow Punk Pin is a trophy from his first successful raid.",
